{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SooW3fN5HYXCxBJwC4Hk3z","type":"tool_result","content":"export { peek, untracked } from './reactivity.js'\nexport { define } from './builders.js'\nexport type { TypedEvent } from './types.js'\nexport type {\n    MicrotagElementClass,\n    RenderContext,\n    RenderFn,\n    RenderOptions,\n    RenderProps,\n    StaticRenderFn,\n} from './builders.js'\n# ADR-006: Authored HTML scaffold served by Hono\n\n**Date:** 2026-09-25 (amended 2026-09-26)\n\n**Status:** Accepted\n\n## Context\n\nThe hydration example used to author its whole document inside a\ntemplate literal and generate an ignored `index.html`. None of the\nordinary HTML tooling applied, and the example did not show a server\nchoosing a route and returning a complete document, which is the\nsituation microtags is meant for.\n\nSee the [research report](../hono-vite-ssr-research.md) for source links,\nalternatives, and repository findings. The report records the original\nproposal (Hono JSX with two outlets); this ADR supersedes those details.\n\n## Decision\n\n`example-hydration/index.html` is the checked-in scaffold. It owns the\ndoctype, head, a static title, the nav, a `<main>` element, and the\nclient entry script. `<main>` holds exactly one `<!--microtags:main-->`\nmarker. The server replaces it once, through a callback so `$&` in\nrendered text stays literal. Zero or several markers is an error.\n\nA Hono app, mounted under `/example-hydration`, owns the routes: the\nindex (canonical with a trailing slash; the bare prefix redirects),\n`/list`, and `/notice`. Other paths go through Hono's not-found handler,\nwhich returns the scaffold with a not-found body and a 404 status.\nnpm warn exec The following package was not found and will be installed: size-limit@12.1.0\n ERROR  Error [ERR_MODULE_NOT_FOUND]: Cannot find package '@size-limit/preset-small-lib' imported from /Users/nick/.npm/_npx/6b8581a651884138/node_modules/size-limit/load-plugins.js\n    at Object.getPackageJSONURL (node:internal/modules/package_json_reader:301:9)\n    at packageResolve (node:internal/modules/esm/resolve:764:81)\n    at moduleResolve (node:internal/modules/esm/resolve:855:18)\n    at defaultResolve (node:internal/modules/esm/resolve:988:11)\n    at #cachedDefaultResolve (node:internal/modules/esm/loader:697:20)\n    at #resolveAndMaybeBlockOnLoaderThread (node:internal/modules/esm/loader:714:38)\n    at ModuleLoader.resolveSync (node:internal/modules/esm/loader:746:52)\n    at #resolve (node:internal/modules/esm/loader:679:17)\n    at ModuleLoader.getOrCreateModuleJob (node:internal/modules/esm/loader:599:35)\n    at onImport.tracePromise.__proto__ (node:internal/modules/esm/loader:628:32)","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d20d9f1c-a441-44ac-9561-525ba24e77e3","uuid":"97163777-b77a-4a13-8d85-b397828ea656","timestamp":"2026-10-04T23:46:14.289Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"export { peek, untracked } from './reactivity.js'\nexport { define } from './builders.js'\nexport type { TypedEvent } from './types.js'\nexport type {\n    MicrotagElementClass,\n    RenderContext,\n    RenderFn,\n    RenderOptions,\n    RenderProps,\n    StaticRenderFn,\n} from './builders.js'\n# ADR-006: Authored HTML scaffold served by Hono\n\n**Date:** 2026-09-25 (amended 2026-09-26)\n\n**Status:** Accepted\n\n## Context\n\nThe hydration example used to author its whole document inside a\ntemplate literal and generate an ignored `index.html`. None of the\nordinary HTML tooling applied, and the example did not show a server\nchoosing a route and returning a complete document, which is the\nsituation microtags is meant for.\n\nSee the [research report](../hono-vite-ssr-research.md) for source links,\nalternatives, and repository findings. The report records the original\nproposal (Hono JSX with two outlets); this ADR supersedes those details.\n\n## Decision\n\n`example-hydration/index.html` is the checked-in scaffold. It owns the\ndoctype, head, a static title, the nav, a `<main>` element, and the\nclient entry script. `<main>` holds exactly one `<!--microtags:main-->`\nmarker. The server replaces it once, through a callback so `$&` in\nrendered text stays literal. Zero or several markers is an error.\n\nA Hono app, mounted under `/example-hydration`, owns the routes: the\nindex (canonical with a trailing slash; the bare prefix redirects),\n`/list`, and `/notice`. Other paths go through Hono's not-found handler,\nwhich returns the scaffold with a not-found body and a 404 status.\nnpm warn exec The following package was not found and will be installed: size-limit@12.1.0\n ERROR  Error [ERR_MODULE_NOT_FOUND]: Cannot find package '@size-limit/preset-small-lib' imported from /Users/nick/.npm/_npx/6b8581a651884138/node_modules/size-limit/load-plugins.js\n    at Object.getPackageJSONURL (node:internal/modules/package_json_reader:301:9)\n    at packageResolve (node:internal/modules/esm/resolve:764:81)\n    at moduleResolve (node:internal/modules/esm/resolve:855:18)\n    at defaultResolve (node:internal/modules/esm/resolve:988:11)\n    at #cachedDefaultResolve (node:internal/modules/esm/loader:697:20)\n    at #resolveAndMaybeBlockOnLoaderThread (node:internal/modules/esm/loader:714:38)\n    at ModuleLoader.resolveSync (node:internal/modules/esm/loader:746:52)\n    at #resolve (node:internal/modules/esm/loader:679:17)\n    at ModuleLoader.getOrCreateModuleJob (node:internal/modules/esm/loader:599:35)\n    at onImport.tracePromise.__proto__ (node:internal/modules/esm/loader:628:32)","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
